  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting Media Freedom</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the programme is to bolster and support the role of independent media globally through: a comprehensive media development intervention improving media resilience in three developing countries and increasing global learning about effective ways of supporting the media; providing a secretariat to the Media Freedom Coalition; and supporting emergency funding to journalists and media in distress in countries experiencing unforeseen or sudden major crises.</narrative>
  </description>
